{"title":"The Martial God Who Regressed To Level 2","synopsis":"Pemusnahan umat manusia yang tidak berharga akan dimulai\nBattle Net yang dianggap sebagai suatu game telah menjadi bencana bagi umat manusia Setelah dilangsungkannya Space League Dimana makhluk dari seluruh alam semesta bersaing untuk hidup mereka masingmasing Perwakilan dari Bumi telah mengalami kekalahan yang berulang Kecuali satu orang dia adalah sang Martial Saint Seong JiHan\nDengan skillnya Nameless Divine Arts menolak penghapusan sistem yang ada Manusia yang sudah dianggap sebagai spesies yang tidak berharga mendapatkan Kesempatan lain Kesempatan itu diberikan kepada Seong JiHan\nKali ini pasti akan berbeda\nKarena dia kembali ke awal setelah melihat akhir dari game itu","alternative_title":"2레벨로 회귀한 무신","author":"Ah Yoongu","artist":"Lee Yoon-Gu","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"da8503df-e575-4a58-b02f-bca6260c5ef3","number":"126","title":"Chapter 126","date":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"id":"686e71d1-5213-4a23-87ac-262c736a47eb","number":"125","title":"Chapter 125","date":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"id":"c0dd01d3-f74e-470d-9c62-54fc3745996d","number":"124","title":"Chapter 124","date":"2026-07-13","images":[]},{"id":"5b756a0c-3ff2-440a-8066-1e77dacccc65","number":"123","title":"Chapter 123","date":"2026-07-06","images":[]},{"id":"bf82a163-dc29-40ba-94c9-277a8a38fdce","number":"122","title":"Chapter 122","date":"2026-06-29","images":[]},{"id":"c118e7da-49fb-49a8-9d1f-cac97da5910c","number":"121","title":"Chapter 121","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"id":"a681900c-ca11-453a-90af-9b969a9441ae","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2026-06-15","images":[]},{"id":"cc618cc9-0b65-47cb-adca-18014832d0ee","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2026-06-01","images":[]},{"id":"ea2bb577-6ec7-4408-b47b-36d33bbea9f7","number":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2026-05-25","images":[]},{"id":"c920316d-9251-46b6-92dc-e2b5907441a0","number":"117","title":"Chapter 1